#: manapak/helpinfo.py:32
msgid ""
"manapak inspects and updates Flatpak applications through "
"gi.repository.Flatpak. It does not execute Flatpak CLI commands."
msgstr ""

#: manapak/helpinfo.py:40
msgid ""
"At startup manapak loads installed applications and asks Flatpak for "
"available updates. Use Check Updates to refresh the catalog. The View "
"selector switches between updates and all installed apps."
msgstr ""

#: manapak/helpinfo.py:49
msgid ""
"Update All applies every available application update. A single application "
"can be updated from the table context menu. Progress and status messages are "
"handled in the background without blocking the main interface."
msgstr ""

#: manapak/helpinfo.py:59
msgid ""
"Open an application's context menu and choose Information to inspect its "
"origin, architecture, branch, runtime, SDK, base application, installed "
"commit and available commit."
msgstr ""

#: manapak/helpinfo.py:68
msgid ""
"User and system Flatpak installations are inspected. System changes are "
"authorized by the operating system's Flatpak and Polkit integration. manapak "
"never invokes sudo or pkexec."
msgstr ""

